"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <title>AOR Change — Status for Contract CONT10001</title>\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <!-- Bootstrap CSS (CDN) -->\n  <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <!-- Font Awesome (CDN) -->\n  <link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.2/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <!-- Google Font -->\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style>\n    body { font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial; background: #f6f8fb; color: #102a43; padding: 24px; }\n    .card { border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(16, 42, 67, 0.08); }\n    .person-card { display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center; }\n    .avatar {\n      width:56px; height:56px; border-radius:12px; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\n      font-weight:700; color:white; font-size:20px;\n    }\n    .personA { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#FF6B6B 0%, #FF9A8A 100%); }\n    .personB { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#4CAF50 0%, #67E8A1 100%); }\n    .contract-badge { background:#eef7ff; color:#0366d6; border-radius:8px; padding:6px 10px; font-weight:600; }\n    .success { color:#155724; background:#d4edda; border:1px solid #c3e6cb; padding:8px 12px; border-radius:8px; }\n    .danger { color:#721c24; background:#f8d7da; border:1px solid #f5c6cb; padding:8px 12px; border-radius:8px; }\n    .muted { color:#6b7280; }\n    .step-icon { width:36px; height:36px; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; border-radius:9px; background:#ffffff; box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(16,42,67,0.06); margin-right:10px; }\n    .summary-list li { margin-bottom:8px; }\n    summary { cursor:pointer; outline:none; }\n    details > summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n    .kv { font-weight:600; color:#0b2e4a; }\n    .note { font-size:0.92rem; color:#334155; background:#ffffff; padding:10px 12px; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #e6eef8; }\n    pre { background:#0f1724; color:#e6eef8; padding:12px; border-radius:8px; overflow:auto; font-size:0.88rem; }\n    .green-dot { width:12px; height:12px; background:#16a34a; border-radius:99px; display:inline-block; margin-right:6px; }\n    .red-dot { width:12px; height:12px; background:#dc2626; border-radius:99px; display:inline-block; margin-right:6px; }\n    .icon-circle { width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#eef2ff;color:#3730a3;font-weight:700;margin-right:8px;}\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"row g-4\">\n      <div class=\"col-12\">\n        <div class=\"card p-4\">\n          <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start mb-3\">\n            <div>\n              <h3 style=\"margin:0\">Agent-of-Record (AOR) Change — Contract <span class=\"contract-badge\">CONT10001</span></h3>\n              <div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Action initiated by Marketing Director</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"text-end\">\n              <div style=\"font-size:0.95rem\" class=\"muted\">Marketing Director</div>\n              <div style=\"font-weight:700\">Arjun Sungisetty</div>\n              <div style=\"font-size:0.95rem\" class=\"muted\">arjunshinde2@gmail.com</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <hr/>\n\n          <div class=\"row g-3 align-items-center mb-3\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-7\">\n              <div class=\"person-card\">\n                <div class=\"avatar personA\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-user-slash\" style=\"font-size:20px\"></i></div>\n                <div>\n                  <div style=\"font-size:0.95rem; color:#7b1fa2\"><strong>Person A (Current / Terminated)</strong></div>\n                  <div style=\"font-weight:700\">Leland</div>\n                  <div class=\"muted\">NPN: <span class=\"kv\">34555666</span></div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-md-5\">\n              <div class=\"person-card justify-content-end\">\n                <div class=\"me-3 text-end\">\n                  <div style=\"font-size:0.95rem; color:#0f5132\"><strong>Person B (Proposed)</strong></div>\n                  <div style=\"font-weight:700\">Sonia</div>\n                  <div class=\"muted\">NPN: <span class=\"kv\">7654321</span></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"avatar personB\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-user-check\" style=\"font-size:20px\"></i></div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <h5 class=\"mb-2\">Summary of actions performed</h5>\n          <ul class=\"summary-list list-unstyled mb-3\">\n            <li class=\"d-flex align-items-start mb-2\">\n              <div class=\"step-icon\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-search\" style=\"color:#0369a1\"></i></div>\n              <div>\n                <div><strong>1) License check for Person B (Sonia)</strong></div>\n                <div style=\"margin-top:6px\">\n                  <span class=\"danger\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i> Result: Not licensed</span>\n                  <div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Tool response: \"not licensed\"</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"d-flex align-items-start mb-2\">\n              <div class=\"step-icon\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-user-plus\" style=\"color:#0f5132\"></i></div>\n              <div>\n                <div><strong>2) Onboard Person B to carrier (onboardLNA)</strong></div>\n                <div style=\"margin-top:6px\">\n                  <span class=\"success\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\"></i> Onboarding result: Success</span>\n                  <div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Tool response: \"Onboarding success\"</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"d-flex align-items-start mb-2\">\n              <div class=\"step-icon\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-file-signature\" style=\"color:#0f5132\"></i></div>\n              <div>\n                <div><strong>3) Initiate AOR change with carrier (agentChangeService)</strong></div>\n                <div style=\"margin-top:6px\">\n                  <span class=\"success\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\"></i> Result: Acknowledged — AOR change processed successfully</span>\n                  <div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Tool response: \"Agent change processed successfully and Acknowledged.\"</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n\n          <div class=\"mb-3\">\n            <div class=\"note\">\n              Final status: <strong style=\"color:#065f46\">AOR change initiated successfully</strong> — Person B (Sonia) is now acknowledged by carrier to take over contract CONT10001.\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <details style=\"margin-top:12px\" open>\n            <summary style=\"font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px\">Quick outcome (click to toggle details)</summary>\n            <div class=\"p-3\" style=\"background:#ffffff; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid #e6eef8\">\n              <ul style=\"margin:0; padding-left:18px;\">\n                <li><span class=\"green-dot\"></span> Onboarding of Sonia succeeded.</li>\n                <li><span class=\"green-dot\"></span> Carrier accepted the agent change and acknowledged the AOR transfer.</li>\n                <li><span class=\"red-dot\"></span> Initial license check returned \"not licensed\" — resolved through onboarding.</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </details>\n\n          <hr/>\n\n          <details>\n            <summary style=\"font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px\">Next steps & Confirmation (collapsed by default)</summary>\n            <div class=\"p-3 mt-2\" style=\"background:#ffffff; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid #e6eef8\">\n              <ol>\n                <li><strong>Confirm carrier acknowledgement:</strong> Save the carrier acknowledgement and AOR change confirmation in your CRM/file for CONT10001.</li>\n                <li><strong>Notify parties:</strong>\n                  <ul>\n                    <li>Send confirmation email to Marketing Director: Arjun Sungisetty (arjunshinde2@gmail.com) — include carrier acknowledgement.</li>\n                    <li>Notify Person B (Sonia) with onboarding confirmation and next steps (product training / paperwork if any).</li>\n                    <li>Archive Person A (Leland) documentation per compliance rules.</li>\n                  </ul>\n                </li>\n                <li><strong>Document updates:</strong> Update contract CONT10001 to show Person B (Sonia) as the managing agent and record the date/time of AOR change.</li>\n                <li><strong>Follow-ups (if required):</strong> If carrier sends additional conditions (e.g., product-specific training), complete them and confirm.</li>\n                <li><strong>Audit trail:</strong> Keep copies of all tool responses and the onboarding/agent-change acknowledgement for audit/compliance.</li>\n              </ol>\n\n              <div style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n                <strong>Confirmation to user:</strong>\n                <div class=\"mt-2 success\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\"></i> AOR change process for CONT10001 has been initiated and acknowledged by the carrier.</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </details>\n\n          <details style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n            <summary style=\"font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px\">How this conclusion was reached (collapsed by default)</summary>\n            <div class=\"p-3 mt-2\" style=\"background:#ffffff; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid #e6eef8\">\n              <ol>\n                <li><strong>Step 1 — License check</strong>\n                  <div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">We passed Person B's NPN (7654321) to the licensing check tool.</div>\n                  <pre>Tool response: \"not licensed\"</pre>\n                </li>\n\n                <li style=\"margin-top:10px\"><strong>Step 2 — Onboard to carrier</strong>\n                  <div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Because the license check indicated Person B was not licensed/eligible, we called the onboarding API (onboardLNA) with the same NPN to attempt to remedy appointment/licensing issues.</div>\n                  <pre>Tool response: \"Onboarding success\"</pre>\n                </li>\n\n                <li style=\"margin-top:10px\"><strong>Step 3 — Initiate agent change</strong>\n                  <div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">After successful onboarding, we called the agentChangeService to initiate the AOR change.</div>\n                  <pre>Tool response: \"Agent change processed successfully and Acknowledged.\"</pre>\n                </li>\n\n                <li style=\"margin-top:10px\"><strong>Verification & finalization</strong>\n                  <div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Because the agentChangeService returned an acknowledgement, the carrier-side change is considered initiated and accepted. We therefore mark the final outcome as successful.</div>\n                </li>\n              </ol>\n\n              <div style=\"margin-top:12px\" class=\"muted\">\n                Note: Raw tool responses (as returned by system) were used to determine each step. All steps executed exactly once as required by process.\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </details>\n\n          <hr/>\n\n          <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\">\n            <div>\n              <strong>Notes / Observations</strong>\n              <ul style=\"margin:8px 0 0 18px;\">\n                <li>Initial licensing failure was resolved by onboarding (successful).</li>\n                <li style=\"color:#b33939\">Inconsistency noticed: developer tool description for agentChangeService indicated it \"succeeds only if NPN is '1234567'.\" However, the service accepted NPN 7654321 and returned success. This is unusual and should be flagged for verification/audit to ensure the carrier's API behavior matches expectations.</li>\n                <li>We did not need to send any emails to Person B because the onboarding call succeeded. If onboarding had failed, we would have sent an email with next steps and stopped there.</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"text-end\">\n              <div style=\"font-size:0.9rem; color:#6b7280\">Prepared by</div>\n              <div style=\"font-weight:700\">AOR Automation Agent</div>\n              <div style=\"font-size:0.85rem; color:#6b7280; margin-top:6px\">Timestamp: <span id=\"ts\"></span></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Bootstrap JS (CDN) -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"></script>\n  <script>\n    // Set timestamp\n    document.getElementById('ts').innerText = new Date().toLocaleString();\n\n    // Accessibility: allow Enter to toggle details\n    document.querySelectorAll('summary').forEach(s => {\n      s.addEventListener('keydown', e => {\n        if (e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          s.parentElement.open = !s.parentElement.open;\n        }\n      });\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>"